.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Test that only the first row can be the header row (Markdown supports a single header row), that rows having
.# less cells than the others are not padded (they are valid), and that pipes and new lines in cells are rendered so
.# that they don't break the table
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|=a|=b|=c
|=d|=e|=f
|x~|y|z\\w|v
|u
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|  a   |    b    |  c  |
| ---- | ------- | --- |
|  d   |    e    |  f  |
| x\|y | z<br/>w |  v  |
|  u   |
